"角色设计","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:35430","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"春奈 有美","creatorId":"vndb:s1634","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1634","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1634","name":"木川 絵理子","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:35432","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c1519","characterName":"北嶋 楓","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"16345","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"45060"},{"characterId":"16345","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"85276"}],"egsCharacterIds":["557"],"vndbCharacterId":"c1519"},"originalCharacterName":"北嶋 楓","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1021"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"90"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An extremely shy and fairly nerdish girl. She is also Sara's cousin and is very protective of her. Second year student of St. Michael's Girl's Academy. She has been elected as class president two years in a row."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1519"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ミカ女の2年生で、クラス委員長を務める才女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"眼鏡に三つ編みという比較的地味なイメージ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格はおとなしめで地味だが、責任感がありクラスの信頼も高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"背も高く胸も大きいナイスバディの持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"眼鏡＆三つ編み無しの姿が実は美少女であることが発覚し、現在は有名人に。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"従妹の紗良とは校内の公認カップルで、楓からも積極的に愛情表現をする関係に。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"557","sourceWorkId":"17326","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ミカ女の３年生で、クラス委員長を務める才女。眼鏡に三つ編みという比較的地味なイメージ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格はおとなしめで地味だが、責任感がありクラスの信頼も高い。背も高く胸も大きいナイスバディの持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"従妹の紗良とは校内の公認カップルで、楓からも積極的に愛情表現をする関係に。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在は紗良とペアで芸能活動をするハメになり、テレビにも出演する多忙な日々を送っている模様。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"557","sourceWorkId":"19119","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"二年级学生，性格内向，是个传统意义上的好孩子，也因此而朋友不多。每个学期都会被高票选为班长，但自己却不喜欢引人注目，又反而因自认为过于平庸而自卑，实际上相当受欢迎。一直很细心照顾堂妹纱良。另外，与松原优菜关系良好。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"声：五行なずな(=小野涼子)"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"16345"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1b/1b2e81feffc951b839f4a720908c3478783ac619fc43ca6f866fec23a137be2f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cf/cf5bc87f114ac07c93eb837dc484b9a3e67866b896f7fe3c736045680c9b093d.webp","width":86,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小野涼子","creatorId":"vndb:s367","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s367","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s367","name":"小野 涼子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:48013:16345:4727:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c1521","characterName":"松原優菜","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"16346","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"45060"},{"characterId":"16346","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"85276"}],"egsCharacterIds":["556"],"vndbCharacterId":"c1521"},"originalCharacterName":"松原優菜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1104"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"87"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"170"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A second-year high school student. She is smart, attractive, popular and rich girl who is admired by the students of St. Michael's. Yet she falls in love with the clumsy and average Nanami."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1521"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ミカ女の2年生で、実質上の学生会である「環境整備委員会」の委員長で、両親は大病院の院長というお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ややおっとりはしているものの、知的美人で性格も温厚。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"スポーツ万能で巨乳の持ち主という正に完璧超人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"下級生はもちろん、上級生にまで慕われる学園のアイドル的存在だが、当人にその自覚はなくやや天然体質。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ところが……実はかなりの甘えん坊でエロ乙女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"で、身も心もめいっぱい尽くさないと気が済まない困った性格。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"556","sourceWorkId":"17326","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ミカ女の３年生で、実質上の学生会である「環境整備委員会」の委員長で、両親は大病院の院長というお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ややおっとりはしているものの、知的美人で性格も温厚。スポーツ万能で巨乳の持ち主という正に完璧超人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"相変わらずかなりの甘えん坊でエロ乙女。七海の事となると、なりふり構わず取り乱してしまう一面も。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"委員長の引退を前に、恋人でもある七海相手に、猛スパルタの特訓中の毎日を過ごしているらしい。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"556","sourceWorkId":"19119","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"米卡女校二年级学生，环境整备委员会会长，在同学之间很吸引目光，是个各方面都很完美的大小姐，而内心十分天然呆以及好色。未来的志向是当医生。与织田七海邂逅的同时也喜欢上了她。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"16346"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a9/a9c072803dc6fbb6f24e92724427bc16b55006ea909060fd3e71c384d64c961c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/35/3558bbc922b5417b53a3a81266db79cd6c97917360352188772a3f0c479c9aba.webp","width":84,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岩村琴美","creatorId":"vndb:s1172","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1172","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1172","name":"岩村 琴美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:48013:16346:4813:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c5721","characterName":"織田 七海","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"16650","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"45060"},{"characterId":"16650","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"85276"}],"egsCharacterIds":["555"],"vndbCharacterId":"c5721"},"originalCharacterName":"織田 七海","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"515"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"75"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"160"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A first-year high school student. Despite being a pretty average girl with bad luck, she has caught the attention of the famous Yuuna."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5721"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ミカ女の２年生で、明るく元気で人見知りをしない性格。上級生である優菜とは恋人同士。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"優菜共々「環境整備委員会」のメンバーで、優菜の跡を継いで委員長になる為に現在猛勉強中。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実はちょっと妄想癖豊かな耳年増少女。頭の中は、いつも優菜とのラブロマンスでいっぱい！？"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"イマイチ育たないおっぱいと、ぷにぷにしたお腹が悩みの恋する乙女。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"555","sourceWorkId":"19119","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"米卡女校的新生，不擅长学习，但却为了考上米卡女校（原因是学校制服漂亮）而拼命读书并最终遂愿。家境普通，有点不适应周围全是大小姐的环境。在新生入学典礼当天对优菜一见钟情，因此进入环境整备委员会。后来应优菜的要求称其为“姐姐大人”。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"声：元祖版:十色冬香，唇とキスで＋新装版:春奈有美 (bgm.tv二者皆查不到…)"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"16650"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/32/32dc36aa1260afa4c96ab20f03ca5a5e9a3b64602f2a611f942debc80ce3bdb1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b8/b843db9158f0dba25c6e86dea88a462c4a71085c96a4971d6106df4357a15bf6.webp","width":89,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"木川絵理子","creatorId":"vndb:s1634","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1634","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1634","name":"木川 絵理子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:48013:16650:4668:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c5858","characterName":"沢口 麻衣","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"16343","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"45060"},{"characterId":"16343","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"85276"}],"egsCharacterIds":["559"],"vndbCharacterId":"c5858"},"originalCharacterName":"沢口 麻衣","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"918"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A very responsible second year high school student who has some tomboy tendencies. She falls in love with Reo after getting to know a different side of her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5858"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"2年生で、幼稚舎からミカ女に通っている生粋のミカ女育ちだが、両親はフツーの共働き夫婦。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特にクラス委員というわけではないものの、面倒見のいい姉御的性格のせいか、頼りにされる事が多い模様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"当人的には「自分は庶民」と自覚。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ミカ女暮らしが長いので、天然お嬢様達の扱いは手慣れている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな物怖じしない性格と行動的なところが人気で、下級生や上級生からラブレターをもらうことも珍しくない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"559","sourceWorkId":"17326","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"３年生で、幼稚舎からミカ女に通っている生粋のミカ女育ちだが、両親はフツーの共働き夫婦。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特にクラス委員というわけではないものの、面倒見のいい姉御的性格のせいか、頼りにされる事が多い模様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな物怖じしない性格と行動的なところが人気で、下級生や上級生からラブレターをもらうことも珍しくない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスメイトの玲緒とは恋人同士で、現在は玲緒の部屋にほぼ毎日通っている、いわゆる通い妻状態。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"559","sourceWorkId":"19119","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"二年级学生，学习成绩和运动神经都相当不错，也擅长做家务，不是学生委员却非常有号召力，成为被大家像大姐姐一样依靠的人气焦点，连身为会长的松原优菜也很重视她，但她总是以生活在普通家庭中的“庶民”自嘲。因为帮助难以适应班级生活的玲绪而与她日渐亲密。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"16343"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/36/36a115cb6928b81254e5e0f9fe3d62942c928937e54307e0a1f3d4c05184559c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/98/98c508a246ceb26b4e4091f8d731c6e973717574f3bdb7ac2eb0cef40dc83f77.webp","width":87,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"峯香織","creatorId":"vndb:s20187","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s20187","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s20187","name":"峯香織","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:48013:16343:5481:1","source":"bangumi"},{"creditedName":"和泉 あやか","creatorId":"vndb:s493","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s493","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s493","name":"和泉あやか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:19010","source":"vndb"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p437","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:1942","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p437","name":"ふぐり屋","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:10828:1942","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p18672","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p18672","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p18672","name":"iqdhk8t0hxww","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:131931:v2511","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p25657","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p25657","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p25657","name":"Pufkein Translate Limited™ ©","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:133137:v2511","source":